        <Label layout="60.0,1020.0,1550.0,25.0" text="R9 / All ceiling grilles at 2.70 m AFF. Corridor T / RH / CO2 sensors proposed / unbound." font="11.0pt sans-serif" foreground="#35454e" halign="left" />
        <Label layout="60.0,1050.0,1550.0,25.0" text="Airflow values are concept calculations. Sizes require manufacturer throw/NC/pressure selection and TAB." font="bold 12.0pt sans-serif" foreground="#35454e" halign="left" />
        <Label layout="60.0,1084.0,1550.0,25.0" text="General motorized dampers are not rated fire/smoke dampers. Protected fire stairs and exit strategy remain subject to approval." font="11.0pt sans-serif" foreground="#35454e" halign="left" />
        <Label layout="60.0,1118.0,1550.0,25.0" text="PM-F03 / BTU-F03 measure A + B together. Company bills need tenant submeters or agreed allocation." font="11.0pt sans-serif" foreground="#35454e" halign="left" />
